msgid "=== \"Atlas 950DT\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 950DT\""

msgid "**This path uses**"
msgstr "**本路径使用**"

msgid ""
"- Image: a prebuilt image specifically for Atlas 950DT\n"
"    - Environment verification: the NPU, PyTorch, and vLLM Ascend plugin inside the container\n"
"    - Model verification reference: [DeepSeek-V4-Flash](../tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md)"
msgstr ""
"- 镜像：Atlas 950DT 专用预构建镜像；\n"
"    - 环境验证：容器内 NPU、PyTorch 和 vLLM Ascend plugin；\n"
"    - 模型验证参考：[DeepSeek-V4-Flash](../tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md)。"

msgid "### 3.1 Start the Container {: #quickstart-atlas-950dt-container }"
msgstr "### 3.1 启动容器 {: #quickstart-atlas-950dt-container }"

msgid "The commands below expose eight NPUs on an Atlas 950DT node. Before running a command, confirm that `/dev/davinci0` through `/dev/davinci7` exist on the host and adjust the command for the actual device topology."
msgstr "下面的命令暴露一个 Atlas 950DT 节点上的 8 个 NPU。执行前确认 Host 上存在 `/dev/davinci0` 到 `/dev/davinci7`，并按实际设备拓扑调整。"

msgid "=== \"Ubuntu\""
msgstr "=== \"Ubuntu\""

msgid "=== \"openEuler\""
msgstr "=== \"openEuler\""

msgid "<a id=\"quickstart-atlas-950dt-verify\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"quickstart-atlas-950dt-verify\"></a>"

msgid "{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/container_verification.inc.md\" %}"
msgstr "{% include \"getting_started/quick_start/container_verification.inc.md\" %}"

msgid "### 3.3 Verify a Model {: #quickstart-atlas-950dt-model }"
msgstr "### 3.3 验证模型 {: #quickstart-atlas-950dt-model }"

msgid "Model deployment on Atlas 950DT might require a specialized device topology, parallelism, communication, quantization, NPU memory, and runtime parameters. After verifying the container environment above, continue in the following order:"
msgstr "Atlas 950DT 上的模型部署可能需要专用的设备拓扑、并行、通信、量化、显存和 runtime 参数。完成上面的容器环境验证后，请按以下顺序继续："

msgid ""
"1. Check the current support status of the model on Atlas 950DT in [Supported Models](../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md).\n"
"    2. Follow [DeepSeek-V4-Flash](../tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md) to prepare the model weights and model-specific parameters.\n"
"    3. Adjust the deployment parameters for the actual 950DT topology, and then verify the model."
msgstr ""
"1. 在 [Supported Models](../user_guide/support_matrix/supported_models.md) 确认模型与 Atlas 950DT 的当前支持状态；\n"
"    2. 参考 [DeepSeek-V4-Flash](../tutorials/models/DeepSeek-V4-Flash.md) 准备模型权重和模型专用参数；\n"
"    3. 根据 950DT 的实际拓扑调整部署参数后执行模型验证。"

msgid "This page does not repeat the general A2/A3 model commands, to avoid giving the impression that a command that only verifies the environment also verifies a model on 950DT."
msgstr "本页不复制 A2/A3 的通用模型命令，避免把仅完成环境验证的命令误认为已完成 950DT 模型验证。"
